      "video_id": "QZNB21kQCgQ",
      "idx": 164,
      "start_s": 499.52,
      "end_s": 508.56,
      "text": "We got fewer children dying before they turned five, which in a hunter-gatherer camp used to happen to roughly four out of every 10.",
